//@changes v1.35.11 - API/proxy store value help now switches by API key kind, showing newline key-rotation guidance for API keys and comma-separated Service Account JSON examples; the provider hint now clarifies blank values save as custom. v1.35.10 - Legacy Vertex Token Bridge URL migration now copies only the Vertex proxy URL without enabling direct proxy mode, and automatic explicit caching controls show a red do-not-use warning while testing continues. v1.35.9 - Provider help popovers now support hover/pinned toggle reset, Vercel quick presets clear stale managed fields, Vertex Token Bridge URLs migrate to Vertex proxy settings, and Gemini explicit-cache controls moved from global defaults into Gemini/Vertex provider tabs.
